src retains upstream source, including unmodified generated custom/studio
protobuf codecs. One local patch to src/index.ts releases stream locks in
finally blocks and rejects enum-valued generic errors (zero) instead of
mistaking them for success. lib was compiled locally using this application's TypeScript compiler
(target ES2022, module ES2020, declaration, esModuleInterop, skipLibCheck).
The packaging manifest is reduced to remove install-time source generation,
git submodule/network operations and upstream development dependencies.
Regeneration of the envelope requires the upstream pinned messages submodule;
normal application installation uses the checked-in compiled codecs.

A second local patch accepts a zero-ID RPC_NOT_FOUND response solely to the
read-only listCustomSubsystems request. Older firmware omits the request ID
when rejecting the unknown custom subsystem; all other mismatched IDs remain
errors. Verified against the existing keyboard before updating firmware.
